# Acceptance-contract-anchored tests live here.
#
# Sr QA (council persona) is the sole author of files under this
# directory. Each test file lives at
# `tests/acceptance/<contract-slug>/<criterion-id>.test.sh` and
# starts with a `# criterion: <id>` header that resolves against
# the binding Acceptance Contract at
# `.yoke/acceptance-contracts/<contract-slug>.md`.
#
# Sr Eng (council persona) MUST NOT author files here. An Sr-Eng-
# authored entry under this directory is a distinct-objective
# failure caught by the `sr-eng-objective-distinct-from-validator`
# sensor. Happy-path unit tests live next to the code they cover
# under `tests/runtime/` or `tests/<module>/`.
#
# This file is a placeholder so the directory ships in git; remove
# it once a contract-slug subdirectory is committed.
